Compute Koenderink scale-space Shape Index at a 4-pixel Gaussian aperture:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"41d5c380-edb0-4079-b2a1-c1341e3e48fb"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sc", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ComputeScaleSpaceCurvature", "[", 
    RowBox[{"exr", ",", " ", "4.0"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
